 "remarks": "Magnificent new construction by AR Luxury Homes on a flat, private acre at the end of a coveted cul-de-sac in Greens Farms. Thoughtfully designed finishes by Tara Benet Design of Greenwich, this 6-bedroom, 6 full/2 half bath residence offers 7,874 sq ft across the first and second floors, plus a finished 1,950+/- sq ft walk-out lower level. Soaring 10' first-floor ceilings anchor an open plan with a great room, custom kitchen, formal dining room, living room, office, wet bar, and mudroom. The primary suite offers a spa bath and walk-in closet, with four additional ensuite bedrooms. The walk-out lower level includes a bedroom, full bath, playroom, gym, and ample storage. Outside, enjoy a 20' x 40' heated pool with spa and automatic cover on a bucolic property. City water, septic, and propane service the home. There is space for an elevator to all floors that can be added, and 1,800 sq ft can be finished on the walk up third floor at additional cost. A rare opportunity, with time to customize select finishes. Home to be completed late spring 2027.",
